OL,3,AFour killed in Gaza after sand
OL,4,Aembankment collapses onto tents, health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree children and one woman were
OL,8,Fkilled when a sand embankment collapsed
OL,9,Fonto tents in central Gaza following
OL,10,Fheavy rain, the Hamas-run health
OL,11,Fministry says.
OL,13,FFive injured people were also
OL,14,Freportedly rescued after the incident
OL,15,Fon Sunday night at a camp for displaced
OL,16,Ffamilies south of Deir al-Balah.
OL,18,FVideos showed men using phone torches
OL,19,Fto search for survivors beneath
OL,20,Fboulders, sand and collapsed tents.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
