OL,3,AFour killed in Gaza after sand
OL,4,Aembankment collapses onto tents, health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Civil Defence service, which
OL,8,Foperates under the Hamas-run interior
OL,9,Fministry, said the "humanitarian
OL,10,Ftragedy" should prompt urgent action by
OL,11,Finternational organisations to provide
OL,12,Fsafe shelters for displaced people and
OL,13,Fmove tents away from sandy areas,
OL,14,Fslopes and locations at risk of
OL,15,Fcollapse.
